<title>POLAND: OLAWA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>OLAWA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.47 vs   0.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.76 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.70 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Sales		    5.51 vs   4.30</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.59 vs   1.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.24 vs   3.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.64 vs   2.86</p>
<p> Sales		   33.24 vs  27.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metal smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Metali Niezelaznych Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
